            <div class="space-y-6">
              <h2 class="text-t-off-white mobilem:text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-xl lg:text-4xl font-avenirBold leading-tight uppercase">
                What makes <span class="text-t-green">ai-Powered</span> Pickleball Machines Different?
              </h2>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                A <span class="text-t-green">traditional pickleball</span> machine serves one basic function: launching balls at fixed speeds and intervals. While helpful for repetitive drills, these machines lack variety, adaptability, and the ability to simulate real match conditions.
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                AI-powered machines, like the Tennibot Partner, take training to a whole new level.
              </p>
              
              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                Unlike conventional machines, AI-driven models offer intelligent, adaptive training. They don’t just repeat pre-set patterns they learn from your performance and adjust in real time. Whether you're a beginner working on fundamentals or a competitive player fine-tuning strategy, these machines can tailor shot speed, spin, trajectory, and frequency to match your skill level and goals.
              </p>

              <p class="text-t-off-white sm:text-lg text-base font-pluto leading-relaxed">
                You can program complex drills, simulate realistic rally scenarios, and even recreate pressure situations all without needing a training partner. With pinpoint accuracy and endless customization options, AI-powered machines help you build muscle memory faster, correct technique more effectively, and elevate your game with every session.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="h-[50vh] md:h-[60vh] lg:h-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
               <img
                src={TennibotMachine.src}
                alt="Tennibot Mobile App Interface"
                fetchpriority="high"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    </section>

